    <div>

      <p begin="00:09.600" end="00:11.590" ttm:agent="v1">Nate Goyard</p>

      <p begin="00:11.590" end="00:13.550" ttm:agent="v1">Ay, like what it do, ay</p>

      <p begin="00:13.550" end="00:16.650" ttm:agent="v1">I just put a two shawty swervin' in a coupe, ay (Skrrt)</p>

      <p begin="00:16.650" end="00:19.810" ttm:agent="v1">Chief Keef, I don't love no thotties, put it on the troop, ay</p>

      <p begin="00:19.810" end="00:23.030" ttm:agent="v1">That bih got like ten plus bodies, I just told her who, ay</p>

      <p begin="00:23.030" end="00:24.960" ttm:agent="v1">She be for the homies, yeah, you know she for the-</p>

      <p begin="00:24.960" end="00:26.460" ttm:agent="v1">Like what it do, ay</p>

      <p begin="00:26.350" end="00:29.450" ttm:agent="v1">I just put a two shawty swervin' in a coupe, ay (Skrrt)</p>

      <p begin="00:29.450" end="00:32.700" ttm:agent="v1">Chief Keef, why I don't love no thotties, put it on the troop, ay</p>

      <p begin="00:32.700" end="00:35.860" ttm:agent="v1">That bih got like ten plus bodies, I just told her who, ay</p>

      <p begin="00:35.860" end="00:38.110" ttm:agent="v1">She be for the homies, yeah, you know she for the-</p>

      <p begin="00:38.110" end="00:39.610" ttm:agent="v1">I never cruise</p>

      <p begin="00:39.190" end="00:42.360" ttm:agent="v1">They just see me winning and they know I'm 'bout to blow, ay</p>

      <p begin="00:42.360" end="00:45.580" ttm:agent="v1">We be making nothing but this music give me dough, ay</p>

      <p begin="00:45.580" end="00:48.370" ttm:agent="v1">First song that I made, I recorded on my phone, ay</p>

      <p begin="00:48.370" end="00:50.720" ttm:agent="v1">Now it's got two mil, I said: &quot;Pass my only-&quot;</p>

      <p begin="00:50.720" end="00:52.220" ttm:agent="v1">Like, woah, ay</p>

      <p begin="00:51.820" end="00:54.770" ttm:agent="v1">Damn, my wrist too cold, ay, and my chain be nice</p>

      <p begin="00:54.770" end="00:57.060" ttm:agent="v1">It just hang down to the floor, ay</p>

      <p begin="00:57.060" end="00:58.560" ttm:agent="v1">Like, woah, ay</p>

      <p begin="00:58.240" end="01:00.460" ttm:agent="v1">Get the bag and go, ay</p>

      <p begin="01:00.460" end="01:03.210" ttm:agent="v1">They say I never miss, that's why I be on a roll, ay</p>

      <p begin="01:03.210" end="01:04.860" ttm:agent="v1">Like what it do, yuh</p>

      <p begin="01:04.860" end="01:08.080" ttm:agent="v1">I got four goth bitches posted in my room, yuh</p>

      <p begin="01:08.080" end="01:11.160" ttm:agent="v1">I don't want no side bitches, I'm just wantin' you (Wantin' you)</p>

      <p begin="01:11.160" end="01:14.450" ttm:agent="v1">When we all alone, I know I gotchu in a mood (Yuh)</p>

      <p begin="01:14.450" end="01:16.230" ttm:agent="v1">Gotchu in a mood, yuh</p>

      <p begin="01:16.230" end="01:19.750" ttm:agent="v1">I got a bad bittie, hella titty, rockin' Air Force Ones (Yuh)</p>

      <p begin="01:19.750" end="01:22.900" ttm:agent="v1">She fuck with me and my team because she know that we is up, yuh</p>

      <p begin="01:22.900" end="01:25.280" ttm:agent="v1">That bitch just want attention, I ain't talkin' bubblegum</p>

      <p begin="01:25.280" end="01:28.940" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, your bitch all in my mentions, yeah, you streamin' all my songs</p>

      <p begin="01:28.940" end="01:30.440" ttm:agent="v1">Ay, like what it do, ay</p>

      <p begin="01:30.390" end="01:33.430" ttm:agent="v1">I just put a two shawty swervin' in a coupe, ay (Skrrt)</p>

      <p begin="01:33.430" end="01:36.680" ttm:agent="v1">Chief Keef, I don't love no thotties, put it on the troop, ay</p>

      <p begin="01:36.680" end="01:39.810" ttm:agent="v1">That bih got like ten plus bodies, I just told her who, ay</p>

      <p begin="01:39.810" end="01:41.760" ttm:agent="v1">She be for the homies, yeah, you know she for the-</p>

      <p begin="01:41.760" end="01:43.260" ttm:agent="v1">Like what it do, ay</p>

      <p begin="01:43.150" end="01:46.260" ttm:agent="v1">I just put a two shawty swervin' in a coupe, ay (Skrrt)</p>

      <p begin="01:46.260" end="01:49.520" ttm:agent="v1">Chief Keef, why I don't love no thotties, put it on the troop, ay</p>

      <p begin="01:49.520" end="01:52.650" ttm:agent="v1">That bih got like ten plus bodies, I just told her who, ay</p>

      <p begin="01:52.650" end="01:55.330" ttm:agent="v1">She be for the homies, yeah, you know she for the group</p>

      <p begin="01:55.330" end="01:59.120" ttm:agent="v1">Uh, hit my phone like: &quot;What it do, baby, what's good?&quot;</p>

      <p begin="01:59.120" end="02:02.240" ttm:agent="v1">We gon' catch a flight home you can show me what's good</p>

      <p begin="02:02.240" end="02:03.740" ttm:agent="v1">Dripped up, dripped up,</p>

      <p begin="02:03.500" end="02:05.900" ttm:agent="v1">So drunk that I'm probably gonna send texts</p>

      <p begin="02:05.900" end="02:07.910" ttm:agent="v1">Through, like, damn, girl, I wish that I could</p>

      <p begin="02:07.910" end="02:10.420" ttm:agent="v1">Uh, but what it do?</p>

      <p begin="02:10.420" end="02:13.530" ttm:agent="v1">I could buy you anything you want, I'm wantin' you</p>

      <p begin="02:13.530" end="02:16.790" ttm:agent="v1">Drunker that I get you start to look like Sailor Moon</p>

      <p begin="02:16.790" end="02:20.080" ttm:agent="v1">Take you out to Paris, introduce you to my goons</p>

      <p begin="02:20.080" end="02:23.070" ttm:agent="v1">All my shots is wetty, do I even gotta shoot?</p>

      <p begin="02:23.070" end="02:24.850" ttm:agent="v1">Fuck it, I'ma shoot, uh</p>

      <p begin="02:24.850" end="02:27.900" ttm:agent="v1">You was in the streets and I was in this shit for you</p>

      <p begin="02:27.900" end="02:31.140" ttm:agent="v1">Know you out there wildin' when I'm halfway pullin' through</p>

      <p begin="02:31.140" end="02:39.140" ttm:agent="v1">Hit for the one time, then I'm throwin' up the duce, uh</p>

